bootexpect \[terrain-adaptation\].*7 sunk
bootreject \[terrain-adaptation\].*ignored
> execute positioned 2144 70 -2592 run locate biome terralith:alpine_highlands
waitlog nearest terralith:alpine_highlands is at 300
