> execute positioned {DO1+80} 40 {DO3} run place structure philipsruins:ocean_fortress
reject (?i)failed to place
look crypt: ground ring at the entrance roof, no pit, rooms open (screenshots in the client block at the logged positions); record how the seabed ruins sit for brief #3 (ST-238)

