## SQ-EF-08 | metas inland build with short parts; at the beach not placed; survive a restart
# seed 8675309: x -80..-40 z -16..100 is ocean / beach (r1031); inland = plains near 1762 -3249, beach near 1792 -2208
> execute positioned 1840 100 -3249 run place structure creativeengineering:meta/farmers_camp
> execute positioned 1762 100 -3150 run place structure creativeengineering:meta/house_camp
> execute positioned 1680 100 -3249 run place structure creativeengineering:meta/ruin_scatter
> execute positioned 1792 100 -2208 run place structure creativeengineering:meta/farmers_camp
bootexpect (?i)\[meta.*short:
expect not placed, no anchor fits
look after this batch: save-all, stop, boot, then "locate structure creativeengineering:meta/farmers_camp" finds a naturally built one (a /place structure start is never locatable, vanilla) and the boot log has no MetaStructure error (ST-241); any "dropped K of N parts" line names satellite ids

